em]\"><nav class=\"xl:pr-[3.25rem] md:pr-[1.75rem] md:border-none md:pb-0 md:mb-0 mb-[1.5rem] pb-[1rem] border-b border-[#D3D3D3] side-nav\"><ul class=\"flex md:flex-col flex-row md:justify-start justify-end gap-[1rem] md:gap-0 text-right font-[lora-sans]\"><li class=\"text-[1.15rem]\"><a class=\"transition-[color] duration-[350ms] \n              text-[#000] hover:text-[#000]\" href=\"/\">about</a></li><li class=\"text-[1.15rem]\"><a class=\"transition-[color] duration-[350ms] \n              text-[#808080]\" href=\"/resume\">resume</a></li><li class=\"text-[1.15rem]\"><a class=\"transition-[color] duration-[350ms] \n              text-[#808080]\" href=\"/projects\">projects</a></li><li class=\"text-[1.15rem]\"><a class=\"transition-[color] duration-[350ms] \n              text-[#808080]\" href=\"/thoughts\">thoughts</a></li></ul></nav><main class=\"max-w-2xl w-full md:border-l md:border-[#D3D3D3] xl:pl-[3.25rem] md:pl-[1.75rem]\"><section class=\"md-content\"><div><h1>About</h1>\n<p>My name is Ken Kozma and I'm a full stack web developer living between the Philippines 🇵🇭 and the United States 🇺🇸.</p>\n<p>I've spent the majority of my career building interactive and functional web interfaces that solve business problems and provide external value for large businesses, public figures and non-profit organizations. I thrive best in well-organized and remote environments where creativity and problem-solving skills can be utilized to produce value.</p>\n<p>In my free time, you'll find me trying to balance being a father, running and synchronizing naps with my little one.</p>\n<p>Learn more about recent my <a href=\"/projects\">/projects</a> or what's on my mind at <a href=\"/thoughts\">/thoughts</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:kenkozma17@gmail.com\">Email</a> <a href=\"https://github.com\">Github</a> <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/in/ken-koz\">Linkedin</a></p></div></section></main></div></div></div><script id=\"__NEXT_DATA__\" type=\"application/json\">{\"props\":{