public figures and non-profit organizations. I thrive best in well-organized and remote environments where creativity and problem-solving skills can be utilized to produce value.</p>\n<p>In my free time, you'll find me trying to balance being a father, running and synchronizing naps with my little one.</p>\n<p>Learn more about recent my <a href=\"/projects\">/projects</a> or what's on my mind at <a href=\"/thoughts\">/thoughts</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:kenkozma17@gmail.com\">Email</a> <a href=\"https://github.com\">Github</a> <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/in/ken-koz\">Linkedin</a></p>","meta":{"title":"About Me","date":"Jan 1, 2026","description":"An overview of my background as a web developer, including agency experience, technical strengths, and the approach I take to building thoughtful web experiences."}},"__N_SSG":true}}